  "solution": {
    "text": "The v - x equation from the given graph can be written as<br /><br /><math><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo maxsize=\"1.00em\">(</mo><mo></mo><mo></mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo maxsize=\"1.00em\">)</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></math>... (i)<br />&nbsp;<br /><math><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo maxsize=\"1.00em\">(</mo><mo></mo><mo></mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo maxsize=\"1.00em\">)</mo></mrow><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math><br />&nbsp;<br /><math><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo maxsize=\"1.00em\">(</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo maxsize=\"1.00em\">)</mo></mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow></math><br />&nbsp;<br />Substituting v from Eq. (i) we get,<br /><br /><math><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo maxsize=\"1.00em\">(</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo maxsize=\"1.00em\">)</mo></mrow><mo>&amp;lsqb;</mo><mrow><mo maxsize=\"1.00em\">(</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo maxsize=\"1.00em\">)</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&amp;rsqb;</mo></mrow></math><br />&nbsp;<br /><math><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize=\"1.00em\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo maxsize=\"1.00em\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math><br />&nbsp;<br />Thus, a-x graph is a straight line with positive slope and negative intercept.<br />Correct answer is<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0008348_AnsExp1_1.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"height: 193px; width: 180px;\" />",
